~ start

Zadow: [[Hi|Hello|HackCluber]], nice to meet you!
Zadow: Welcome to your new farm.
Zadow: It might look a little messy right now, but you'll get it cleaned up in no time.

- Need Tutorial?
	Zadow: Of course! Let me show you around.
	Zadow: You can use your axe to chop trees and break rocks around the farm.
	Zadow: You can also use your hoe to prepare the land and grow crops.

- Nah, I'm good.
	Zadow: Alright! You can always ask me later if you need help.

Zadow: Before you get started, do you want to know the controls?

- Yeah, show me the controls.
	Zadow: Sure! Here's a quick overview.
	Zadow: Save Game: You can save your progress from the game menu or by clicking P.
	Zadow: Tools: Use the Axe tool to cut down trees and mine rocks.
	Zadow: Right click to deselect your current tool.
	Zadow: Crops: Use the hoe to prepare the soil, then plant your seeds.
	Zadow: Make sure you water your crops so they can grow.
	Zadow: Day Counter: Keep an eye on the day counter to see which day you're on.
	Zadow: Time Speed: You can change the time speed if you want to make the days go faster.
	Zadow: Faster time can help you test crop growth without waiting as long.
	Zadow: Toolbar & Inventory: You can pick up items around the farm and find them in your inventory.
	Zadow: That's everything you need to know for now!

- Nah, I know the controls.
	Zadow: Alright, let's get started!

Zadow: Take a look around.
Zadow: As you can see, the cows and chickens are hungry.
Zadow: You'll need to grow some crops to keep them fed.
Zadow: First, you'll need to plant some seeds.
Zadow: Here, take these. You can use them to start growing your first crops.

- Take crop seeds
	Nemo (Cat): Yeah, I can grow some crops!
	do GameDialogueManager.action_give_crop_seeds()
	Zadow: Great! Use the hoe to plant them in some tilled soil and make sure you water them.
	Zadow: Once they've grown, you can harvest them and use them to feed the animals.

- No, I don't want them.
	Nemo (Cat): I'm not ready to grow my farm yet.
	Zadow: That's alright. Take your time.
	Zadow: Come talk to me again when you're ready.

=> END
